headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Requests against the Tyyni API. Pick the Local or Vercel environment. For Vercel, copy
  `.env.example` to `.env` (git-ignored) and set API_KEY to the tyyni-api project's key.

  Run "Create user" once, or set `userId` in the environment to an existing user. "Simulate"
  then fills that user's data and stores the first suggestion's id for "Suggestion feedback".
}
